  "helpFaq": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "helpFaq1Q": "How is my data stored?",
  "helpFaq1A": "All your data is stored locally on your device using secure local storage. No data is ever sent to external servers or third parties.",
  "helpFaq2Q": "Can I export my data?",
  "helpFaq2A": "Data export is not currently available. Your data remains securely on your device.",
  "helpFaq3Q": "How do I reset my data?",
  "helpFaq3A": "Go to Settings and select 'Delete All Data'. This will remove all your measurements and goals permanently.",
  "helpFaq4Q": "How do notifications work?",
  "helpFaq4A": "Optional reminders can be enabled in Settings. Notifications are scheduled locally on your device and are not sent over the internet.",
  "helpFaq5Q": "Is an account required?",
  "helpFaq5A": "No. FitTracker works completely offline with no account. Simply open the app and start tracking.",
  "helpFaq6Q": "How do I change my weight unit?",
  "helpFaq6A": "Weight units are displayed in kilograms (kg) based on your input. Unit conversion is planned for a future update.",
